{"id":"e6b94974722658c7","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-beta-function.md","title":"Gödel's β-Function","display":"df-beta-function — Gödel's β-Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-godel-beta","display":"df-beta-function — Gödel's β-Function","aliases":["57-df-godel-beta","57-df-β"],"depends_on":["[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[57-df-primrec-operator]]","[[57-df-composition-operator]]","[[57-df-projection-function]]","[[57-df-addition-function]]","[[57-df-multiplication-function]]","[[57-df-divrem-function]]","[[57-df-factorial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-godel-beta"},{"key":"display","html":"df-beta-function — Gödel's β-Function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-godel-beta</span><span>57-df-β</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"92ef5d19605886fd\" href=\"?note=92ef5d19605886fd\" title=\"57-df-primrec-operator\">57-df-primrec-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"163597d7804b3604\" href=\"?note=163597d7804b3604\" title=\"57-df-projection-function\">57-df-projection-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" href=\"?note=7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" title=\"57-df-addition-function\">57-df-addition-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c6df01b45cb8cc59\" href=\"?note=c6df01b45cb8cc59\" title=\"57-df-multiplication-function\">57-df-multiplication-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"712165bc47a6ac48\" href=\"?note=712165bc47a6ac48\" title=\"57-df-divrem-function\">57-df-divrem-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c39eb67536237339\" href=\"?note=c39eb67536237339\" title=\"57-df-factorial-function\">57-df-factorial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-beta-function-—-Gödel's-β-Function-$\\beta$\">df-beta-function — Gödel's β-Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是整个调用环境中的固定参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\beta:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为下式定义的函数，公开接口仍只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,i\">\\(a,i\\)</span> 两个参数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem},\\mathrm{fact},\\pi_i^n\">\\(\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mul},\\mathrm{div},\\mathrm{rem},\\mathrm{fact},\\pi_i^n\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" href=\"?note=7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" title=\"57-df-addition-function\">57-df-addition-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c6df01b45cb8cc59\" href=\"?note=c6df01b45cb8cc59\" title=\"57-df-multiplication-function\">57-df-multiplication-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"712165bc47a6ac48\" href=\"?note=712165bc47a6ac48\" title=\"57-df-divrem-function\">57-df-divrem-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"c39eb67536237339\" href=\"?note=c39eb67536237339\" title=\"57-df-factorial-function\">57-df-factorial-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"163597d7804b3604\" href=\"?note=163597d7804b3604\" title=\"57-df-projection-function\">57-df-projection-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>、复合及原始递归取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"92ef5d19605886fd\" href=\"?note=92ef5d19605886fd\" title=\"57-df-primrec-operator\">57-df-primrec-operator</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta}\\vdash\\beta(a,i)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rem}\\!\\left(a,1+\\mathrm{mul}(i+1,\\mathrm{div}(a,\\mathrm{fact}(s)))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta}\\vdash\\beta(a,i)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rem}\\!\\left(a,1+\\mathrm{mul}(i+1,\\mathrm{div}(a,\\mathrm{fact}(s)))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta}\\vdash\\forall a,i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\beta(a,i)=a\\bmod\\left(1+(i+1)\\lfloor a/s!\\rfloor\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta}\\vdash\\forall a,i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\beta(a,i)=a\\bmod\\left(1+(i+1)\\lfloor a/s!\\rfloor\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta}\\vdash\\beta\\in\\mathrm{PR}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}beta}\\vdash\\beta\\in\\mathrm{PR}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原来依固定 s 定义的二参数函数及其精确算式，不替换为通常的三参数 Gödel β。该算式及原始递归性本身并不提供任意有限列均可由某个 a 表示的定理；本册新增的机器编码另有独立定义。阶乘恒正，余数运算的除数也恒正。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a> — 原始递归函数类</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"712165bc47a6ac48\" href=\"?note=712165bc47a6ac48\" title=\"57-df-divrem-function\">57-df-divrem-function</a> — 具有显式零除数分支的除法与余数函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" href=\"?note=7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" title=\"57-df-addition-function\">57-df-addition-function</a> — 加法函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"c6df01b45cb8cc59\" href=\"?note=c6df01b45cb8cc59\" title=\"57-df-multiplication-function\">57-df-multiplication-function</a> — 乘法函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"c39eb67536237339\" href=\"?note=c39eb67536237339\" title=\"57-df-factorial-function\">57-df-factorial-function</a> — 阶乘函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a> — 原始递归函数类</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-beta-function-—-Gödel's-β-Function-$\\beta$","text":"df-beta-function — Gödel's β-Function $\\beta$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"